{"id":"n78020-3-8","stage":5,"title":"처지다 · 落下","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78020-3-8-1","ko":"감독님, 제가 앞쪽으로 나가는 게 좋을까요?","zh":"教练，我往前冲比较好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"감독님,","meaning":"教练，导演","explanation":"감독：教练，导演；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"감독","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15979","senseId":"2","lemma":"감독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞쪽으로","meaning":"前面，前头，前部","explanation":"앞쪽：前面，前头，前部；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞쪽","audio":"/audio/ec998989eadbec6bfb43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71505","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가는","meaning":"上，上前","explanation":"나가다：上，上前；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"2","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋을까요?","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7fcf6259bbb0a418","term":"감독","zh":"教练，导演","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3","entryId":"15979","definition":"在演出、电影、体育比赛等中指挥并负责全盘事宜的人。","pronunciation":["감독"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ec998989eadbec6b","term":"앞쪽","zh":"前面，前头，前部","audio":"/audio/ec998989eadbec6bfb43.mp3","entryId":"71505","definition":"向着前面的方向。","pronunciation":["압쪽"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"上，上前","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"向前移动。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/31d0608d9e69a3883d83.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78020-3-8-2","ko":"아니. 뒤에 처져 있다가 기회를 봐서 앞으로 나와.","zh":"先别，留在后面，找准机会再上前。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"不是，不用，不要","explanation":"아니：不是，不用，不要","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒤에","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처져","meaning":"落下，落后，落伍","explanation":"처지다：落下，落后，落伍；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"처지다","audio":"/audio/0566ccf91ba95bb9f3cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78020","senseId":"3","lemma":"처지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있다가","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기회를","meaning":"机会，机遇，时机","explanation":"기회：机会，机遇，时机；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기회","audio":"/audio/1815f64fee30a098d49f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73494","senseId":"1","lemma":"기회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐서","meaning":"寻找， 见","explanation":"보다：寻找， 见；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"29","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나와.","meaning":"出，长出","explanation":"나오다：出，长出；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"2","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不是，不用，不要","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65982","definition":"用于否定回答晚辈或年龄、地位等相等的人所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，后面","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"0566ccf91ba95bb9","term":"처지다","zh":"落下，落后，落伍","audio":"/audio/0566ccf91ba95bb9f3cd.mp3","entryId":"78020","definition":"留在后面或落在后面。","pronunciation":["처ː지다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1815f64fee30a098","term":"기회","zh":"机会，机遇，时机","audio":"/audio/1815f64fee30a098d49f.mp3","entryId":"73494","definition":"适合做某事的时期或状况。","pronunciation":["기회","기훼"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"寻找， 见","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"观察机会、时间、时机是否适当。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，长出","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"从里面冒到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/093390842dd7c61c8e4d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78020","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["先别，留在后面，找准机会再上前。","教练，我往前冲比较好吗？","昨天为什么会被上司骂啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["教练，我往前冲比较好吗？","昨天为什么会被上司骂啊？","先别，留在后面，找准机会再上前。"],"answer":2}]}
